   <div class="notice"><strong>Plain-language boundary.</strong> You can inspect the case, record local draft dispositions, test the internal roles, attach source receipts, and export a handoff packet. Nothing here sends, schedules, pays, publishes, appoints, accepts, or represents on anyone's behalf.</div>
        </div>'''
new_hero = f'''        <div class="hero dossier-cover">
          <div class="cover-copy">
            <div class="eyebrow">Essential Attention · FAB Meeting #1 aftermath</div>
            <div class="cover-index">EA / FAB / N=0 / CASE 001 · SOURCE-BOUND ADMINISTRATIVE INSTRUMENT</div>
            <h1><span class="accent">FAB Meeting #1</span><br>Aftermath Case File</h1>
            <p class="plain-lead">This is the working case file for what the first FAB meeting created. It preserves seven things worth resolving, five decisions that may deserve bounded executive attention, the evidence behind each, and a local record of what this browser does with them.</p>
            <div class="start-actions"><button class="primary" id="startTourButton">Take the guided tour</button><button data-go="register">Open the seven case objects</button><button data-go="overview" class="ghost">Skip to the overview</button></div>
            <div class="notice"><strong>Effect boundary.</strong> You can inspect the case, record local draft dispositions, test the internal roles, attach source receipts, and export a handoff packet. Nothing here sends, schedules, pays, publishes, appoints, accepts, or represents on anyone's behalf.</div>
          </div>
          <aside class="cover-sigil" aria-label="AXM case seal">
